      "x": 450,
      "text": "Cold and rain take their strength. Fires cost one ration; use them wisely."
    },
    {
      "x": 3090,
      "text": "H  uses medicine. TAB  opens the pack and survival notes."
    },
    {
      "x": 3040,
      "text": "Water will soak their clothes and steal their warmth. Find the caretaker’s pump."
    },
    {
      "x": 7390,
      "text": "The books are wet. The roof is loose. One piece of salvage makes a dry way through."
    },
    {
      "x": 10220,
      "text": "The wall is long enough for two. Wait for the light to turn away."
